{"id":"f5ad37ae47035116","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-omitting-types.md","title":"Omitting Types Theorem","display":"thm-omitting-types — Omitting Types Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-omitting-types","aliases":["58-thm-omitting-types"],"display":"thm-omitting-types — Omitting Types Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-omitted.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-omitting-types"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-omitting-types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omitting-types — Omitting Types Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1bd3906a14e9f667\" href=\"?note=1bd3906a14e9f667\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-omitted.md\">../batch19/58-df-omitted.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74518fe8da772d53\" href=\"?note=74518fe8da772d53\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,T,p,\\mathcal P,\\bot,\\mathfrak M\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,T,p,\\mathcal P,\\bot,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"74518fe8da772d53\" href=\"?note=74518fe8da772d53\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"1bd3906a14e9f667\" href=\"?note=1bd3906a14e9f667\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-omitted.md\">../batch19/58-df-omitted.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableSignature}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableSignature}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}types\\text{-}countable\\text{-}signature}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CountableSignature}_S(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L_c,L_f,a_f,L_r,a_r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\langle L_c,L_f,a_f,L_r,a_r\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_f,L_f,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_r,L_r,\\omega)\n\\land|L_c\\cup L_f\\cup L_r|\\leq\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}types\\text{-}countable\\text{-}signature}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CountableSignature}_S(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L_c,L_f,a_f,L_r,a_r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\langle L_c,L_f,a_f,L_r,a_r\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_f,L_f,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_r,L_r,\\omega)\n\\land|L_c\\cup L_f\\cup L_r|\\leq\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}types}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CountableSignature}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\n\\land|T|\\leq\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal L,\\bot)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,\\varnothing,T,\\mathcal L,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S(\\mathcal L,T,\\varnothing,p,n,\\mathcal P,\\bot)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak M,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathfrak M,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}types}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CountableSignature}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\n\\land|T|\\leq\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal L,\\bot)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,\\varnothing,T,\\mathcal L,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S(\\mathcal L,T,\\varnothing,p,n,\\mathcal P,\\bot)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak M,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathfrak M,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Omitting types: we can avoid all realizations of a type.</li>\n<li>It has applications in model theory.</li>\n<li>The theorem now uses the exact parameter set, arity, proof context, model, and omitted-type signatures. Countability and nonisolation are no longer hidden behind undeclared predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-omitted.md","status":"resolved","id":"1bd3906a14e9f667","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-omitted.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"74518fe8da772d53","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Theory}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","